few people are more pro-russian than  this man Igor gherkin at the beginning  of Russia's invasion of Ukraine in  February the self-described ultra  nationalists was a staunch supporter of  the Russian military predicting its  Advanced weaponry and skilled soldiers  would make easy work of the outnumbered  ukrainians  but now gherkin's tone has changed  I have an impression that in October our  Russian army will break into pieces it's  not because they are incompetent or  covertly it's because the Ukraine army  supply lines are much much better than  ours  in the past week during the Ukrainian  counter-offensive countless videos  appeared to show a Russian military and  collapse but throughout this war Moscow  has been particularly Adept at staying  silent and refusing to admit or even  acknowledging setbacks  the tone on Russian State TV talk shows  which for months refrained from any  criticism of the invasion has changed  dramatically with people pointing  fingers at who's to blame for the losses  on the battlefield  people who convinced President Putin the  Special Operation would be fast that we  won't strike civilians that our military  would keep things in order these people  really set us up for this they lied to  us  and on another talk show this we can't  win a full-scale military operation  using only the Russian army and this  talk show and other propaganda the  Ukrainian military offensive in the  Northeast has clearly broken the Russian  front lines but also exposed to deep  cracks within the pro-russia Blogger  community that is now questioning  everything about this war  will it be enough for the Kremlin to  change their tactics or is the Kremlin  even listening  Gabriel ozando Al Jazeera Keith
 

